(6390921, 946660, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wish you hadn''t put the blanket or pillow in the chair. I think the stark white chair would have stood out much better without it. As it is, the image is quite busy. I like the modern style of the chair v.s. the old style of the room, and the white v.s. the warm tones.</td>', 'Wish you hadn''t put the blanket or pillow in the chair. I think the stark white chair would have stood out much better without it. As it is, the image is quite busy. I like the modern style of the chair v.s. the old style of the room, and the white v.s. the warm tones.', '2011-04-20 02:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6390925, 946914, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. I like the curves, the textures, and the muted colors. Where''s your single object?</td>', 'Beautiful image. I like the curves, the textures, and the muted colors. Where''s your single object?', '2011-04-20 02:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
