(6391411, 946718, 126709, '<td valign="top">The shadow and color in the bottom center looks like two little girls standing in the corner.  Don''t know if you intended on that but it makes the photo interesting.</td>', 'The shadow and color in the bottom center looks like two little girls standing in the corner.  Don''t know if you intended on that but it makes the photo interesting.', '2011-04-20 14:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6391412, 947053, 126709, '<td valign="top">Boombox. Haven''t seen one of those in a few years.  Nice color and light.  6</td>', 'Boombox. Haven''t seen one of those in a few years.  Nice color and light.  6', '2011-04-20 14:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6391413, 947162, 126709, '<td valign="top">I like the urban emptiness with the strand of Chistmas lights and wall air conditioner.  Sitting near the window adds a sense of hope instead of despair.</td>', 'I like the urban emptiness with the strand of Chistmas lights and wall air conditioner.  Sitting near the window adds a sense of hope instead of despair.', '2011-04-20 14:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6391447, 947094, 112972, '<td valign="top">Love the tones a lot.  The mouse trap needs to be a little brighter to draw the eye to it more since it is a key element in this photograph.  Currently I am drawn to the pipes in the background.  Still very good image and it should do well. 8!</td>', 'Love the tones a lot.  The mouse trap needs to be a little brighter to draw the eye to it more since it is a key element in this photograph.  Currently I am drawn to the pipes in the background.  Still very good image and it should do well. 8!', '2011-04-20 14:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6391457, 947054, 112972, '<td valign="top">Love the Gothic feel in this one.  Is it me or is the horizon not quite straight?  Great image and should do very well.  9!</td>', 'Love the Gothic feel in this one.  Is it me or is the horizon not quite straight?  Great image and should do very well.  9!', '2011-04-20 14:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6391470, 947135, 112972, '<td valign="top">Cute image, but unfortunately it was taken too close up to give the viewer the sense of an empty room.  It seems like you were trying to decide to enter in this challenge or in the Sadness challenge? Because this could pass for the other one better IMO.   Of course it is a major hassle to move furniture around to create the feel of an empty room for just a challenge, so I understand :)</td>', 'Cute image, but unfortunately it was taken too close up to give the viewer the sense of an empty room.  It seems like you were trying to decide to enter in this challenge or in the Sadness challenge? Because this could pass for the other one better IMO.   Of course it is a major hassle to move furniture around to create the feel of an empty room for just a challenge, so I understand :)', '2011-04-20 15:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6391474, 947140, 114225, '<td valign="top">Really enjoy the tones and lines of this image.</td>', 'Really enjoy the tones and lines of this image.', '2011-04-20 15:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6391475, 946797, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m not so sure that I''m feeling the tilt for this image. What does the tilt add to the story?</td>', 'I''m not so sure that I''m feeling the tilt for this image. What does the tilt add to the story?', '2011-04-20 15:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6391476, 946535, 112972, '<td valign="top">Oh yes!  This is awesome!  Minor nit ... I wish you had cloned out the reflections on the wall in the upper right to eliminate the distraction there. The borders work so well here, btw. 10!</td>', 'Oh yes!  This is awesome!  Minor nit ... I wish you had cloned out the reflections on the wall in the upper right to eliminate the distraction there. The borders work so well here, btw. 10!', '2011-04-20 15:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6391477, 947146, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the positioning of the doll. Tells a story of it being left behind because it was not seen as people were exiting the room.</td>', 'I like the positioning of the doll. Tells a story of it being left behind because it was not seen as people were exiting the room.', '2011-04-20 15:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6391478, 947054, 114225, '<td valign="top">Creepy and telling. I get the feeling that this doll was dropped in a hurried rush to exit the room.</td>', 'Creepy and telling. I get the feeling that this doll was dropped in a hurried rush to exit the room.', '2011-04-20 15:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6391481, 946393, 114225, '<td valign="top">The textures of the mask and room really work well together.</td>', 'The textures of the mask and room really work well together.', '2011-04-20 15:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6391483, 947015, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution.</td>', 'Great idea and execution.', '2011-04-20 15:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6391484, 947094, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like how the B&amp;W conversion has really made the details stick out.</td>', 'I like how the B&W conversion has really made the details stick out.', '2011-04-20 15:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6391485, 947140, 112972, '<td valign="top">Like this a lot except for the way the outdoor light was blended in with the indoor mood.  I absolutely love everything about the indoors part of the image.  The outdoors has that <i>harsh light</i> feel with some pinkish chromatic aberration when I look closely.  An exposure with a faster shutter speed just for the outdoors would have made the blending a lot smoother.  Still a great image and should do extremely well ... perhaps a ribbon.</td>', 'Like this a lot except for the way the outdoor light was blended in with the indoor mood.  I absolutely love everything about the indoors part of the image.  The outdoors has that harsh light feel with some pinkish chromatic aberration when I look closely.  An exposure with a faster shutter speed just for the outdoors would have made the blending a lot smoother.  Still a great image and should do extremely well ... perhaps a ribbon.', '2011-04-20 15:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6391531, 947103, 106484, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but where is the room? I don''t get it.</td>', 'Sorry, but where is the room? I don''t get it.', '2011-04-20 16:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
