(6391886, 947112, 10785, '<td valign="top">Hey... the object is supposed to be in the room. You broke the rules... DNMC you rebel!! No... wait!! Is the photographer in the room and the object outside the room or is the object in the room and the photographer outside the room??? Whoa!!! Mind spinning... speculation churning... this photo is more than just a photo, it is, dare I say it... art! aaarrrggghhhh!!!!</td>', 'Hey... the object is supposed to be in the room. You broke the rules... DNMC you rebel!! No... wait!! Is the photographer in the room and the object outside the room or is the object in the room and the photographer outside the room??? Whoa!!! Mind spinning... speculation churning... this photo is more than just a photo, it is, dare I say it... art! aaarrrggghhhh!!!!', '2011-04-20 23:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6391904, 946744, 69324, '<td valign="top">I slid this image far enough up on the screen to crop out the ceiling. That way I didn''t have to deal with the distraction of the color of the ceiling and the skewed perspective. For me that was a two point difference in my scoring of this image. Brave image, nice work.</td>', 'I slid this image far enough up on the screen to crop out the ceiling. That way I didn''t have to deal with the distraction of the color of the ceiling and the skewed perspective. For me that was a two point difference in my scoring of this image. Brave image, nice work.', '2011-04-20 23:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
