(6392225, 947092, 96751, '<td valign="top">Quite disturbing and well done.  The distortion adds to that sense, although the lighting is too formal and harshly demarcated to instill a sense of foreboding or mystery.  Of course, it adds to the sense of absurdity, which may have been your intention.  But this image is also more about the tableau than it is about an empty room.  Then again, perhaps I''m being too literal in the interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Quite disturbing and well done.  The distortion adds to that sense, although the lighting is too formal and harshly demarcated to instill a sense of foreboding or mystery.  Of course, it adds to the sense of absurdity, which may have been your intention.  But this image is also more about the tableau than it is about an empty room.  Then again, perhaps I''m being too literal in the interpretation of the challenge.', '2011-04-21 13:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
