(6394286, 946393, 77196, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast between the glitz and pristine condition of the mask, and the neglected, drab appearance of the room.</td>', 'I really like the contrast between the glitz and pristine condition of the mask, and the neglected, drab appearance of the room.', '2011-04-24 22:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
