(6394335, 947164, 75618, '<td valign="top">Great find/set-up. The vignetting is really harsh though, makes it seem like a portion of the wall is the focal point.</td>', 'Great find/set-up. The vignetting is really harsh though, makes it seem like a portion of the wall is the focal point.', '2011-04-25 00:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
