(6397145, 947140, 131038, '<td valign="top">I think the windows are better blown out, it prevents the outside content from distracting from the room. What foliage detail is left gives subtle sense of over-growth like some lost school house in the woods. I am a huge fan of HDR and really like to see lots of detail but sometimes less is much more! Nice shot and huge thumbs up to your team for their support!</td>', 'I think the windows are better blown out, it prevents the outside content from distracting from the room. What foliage detail is left gives subtle sense of over-growth like some lost school house in the woods. I am a huge fan of HDR and really like to see lots of detail but sometimes less is much more! Nice shot and huge thumbs up to your team for their support!', '2011-04-27 14:42:17.000000', NULL, 0),
