(6620836, 947164, 61084, '<td valign="top">Thanks Deb, I''ve had quite a lot of people ask me what''s in the box, but I''ve never revealed it....so far. Rest assured there IS something in that box...which is very old.  Probably around 55 to 60 years old and means a lot to me. :) Thanks for all your wonderful comments on my photos today. :)<br/> <br/>Dave</td>', 'Thanks Deb, I''ve had quite a lot of people ask me what''s in the box, but I''ve never revealed it....so far. Rest assured there IS something in that box...which is very old.  Probably around 55 to 60 years old and means a lot to me. :) Thanks for all your wonderful comments on my photos today. :) Dave', '2011-12-18 16:51:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6653547, 946744, 54645, '<td valign="top">I missed this last year, well done.</td>', 'I missed this last year, well done.', '2012-01-24 03:00:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6654856, 946744, 124190, '<td valign="top">I feel trapped too......sucks sometimes......    fluctuates from sharp euphoria to disgusting depressions and doom............. guess that''s what creative people have to bear..........    the only freedom I experience is staying in the moment...preferably the euphoric moments......and observing around me. When I can''t stand myself I listen to guided meditations on CD''s....tends to help.......  when I can''t stand people I cloister myself and tell SOME of them to get out of my way...mostly.  Other than that pretty much wherever I go.....I somehow manage to make people smile.  It just happens....and a joke and a compliment, even to a stranger makes people smile.  And it feels good for both of us.  Energy is all around us.  I paint, draw, do pottery, love my golden retriever...have insane friends..... and tell people to get out of my face when I am sick of them.   I''m never bored.....but pretty much overwhelmed...every day.   you are not alone.   Doesn''t that make you feel better.  ahahahahahh<br/> <br/>Thanks for liking my crazy night landscape.   The altercation.    It''s kinda how I feel when I fight with people........usually after I''ve had too much to drink.   Brings on creativity though.   Van Gogh....Pollack...all of them were nuts....alcoholics.........just don''t kill yourself.  the attempts are not fun.   and they want to put you away without your camera or crayons...........<br/> <br/>You are special.   and Brave ....people care.......<br/> <br/>I have no filters.......it would be different to see this photo with some sort of superimposed electricity coming out of the sockets as if your finger tips are wires....don''t try it though.... just noticed the outlets.<br/> <br/>Now I get to look at more of your photos.....can''t wait!    take care......&gt;vivian<br/> <br/></td>', 'I feel trapped too......sucks sometimes......    fluctuates from sharp euphoria to disgusting depressions and doom............. guess that''s what creative people have to bear..........    the only freedom I experience is staying in the moment...preferably the euphoric moments......and observing around me. When I can''t stand myself I listen to guided meditations on CD''s....tends to help.......  when I can''t stand people I cloister myself and tell SOME of them to get out of my way...mostly.  Other than that pretty much wherever I go.....I somehow manage to make people smile.  It just happens....and a joke and a compliment, even to a stranger makes people smile.  And it feels good for both of us.  Energy is all around us.  I paint, draw, do pottery, love my golden retriever...have insane friends..... and tell people to get out of my face when I am sick of them.   I''m never bored.....but pretty much overwhelmed...every day.   you are not alone.   Doesn''t that make you feel better.  ahahahahahh Thanks for liking my crazy night landscape.   The altercation.    It''s kinda how I feel when I fight with people........usually after I''ve had too much to drink.   Brings on creativity though.   Van Gogh....Pollack...all of them were nuts....alcoholics.........just don''t kill yourself.  the attempts are not fun.   and they want to put you away without your camera or crayons........... You are special.   and Brave ....people care....... I have no filters.......it would be different to see this photo with some sort of superimposed electricity coming out of the sockets as if your finger tips are wires....don''t try it though.... just noticed the outlets. Now I get to look at more of your photos.....can''t wait!    take care......>vivian ', '2012-01-25 14:01:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6690261, 946744, 68956, '<td valign="top">Pleased to discover this thanks to your ''Best of'' entry. Another great image, the ceiling is going to crush you emotionally and you have no protection.<br/>Why would anyone want you to crop the ceiling out? It''d be like taking the cross out of a crucifixion scene!</td>', 'Pleased to discover this thanks to your ''Best of'' entry. Another great image, the ceiling is going to crush you emotionally and you have no protection.Why would anyone want you to crop the ceiling out? It''d be like taking the cross out of a crucifixion scene!', '2012-02-24 08:17:39.000000', NULL, 0);
